title: "Curious Life instrument: a browser-based clock-jitter random event generator"
abstract: "An open-source instrument that collects physical timing noise in a web browser and turns it into a bit stream for mind-matter interaction experiments, with a control channel, stored diagnostics, a load-leakage test and a public calibration record."
